;&quot;&gt;게시 허용 후 실제 출력&lt;br&gt;전달 결과는 다시 기록&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=22;fontColor=#2858A5;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="506.0" y="581" width="226" height="57.2" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n47" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;음성 중단은 업무 취소와 다르다. 생성 완료는 실제 전달과 다르다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=23;fontColor=#5F6B77;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="839" width="1120" height="29.900000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n48" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;01  입력 보호와 처리 병행&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=28;fontColor=#2858A5;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1260" y="364" width="596" height="36.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n49" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;긴 해석 중에도 입력과 중단을 받음.&lt;br&gt;비동기는 두 안의 공통 조건이다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1260" y="411" width="596" height="70" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n50" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;02  정정 전 효과와 전달 제어&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=28;fontColor=#2858A5;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1260" y="515" width="596" height="36.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n51" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;미전송 효과·오래된 응답을 보류하고,&lt;br&gt;실제로 들은 범위에 맞게 이어간다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1260" y="562" width="596" height="70" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n52" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;03  분기·대기·합류의 조직&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=28;fontColor=#2858A5;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1260" y="666" width="596" height="36.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n53" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;중앙의 명령·반환 관리와&lt;br&gt;소비자 활성화·국소 결합을 비교한다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1260" y="713" width="596" height="70" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
